  2.  STORE  LOCATION  &  HOURS  -  Address:  Main  Street,  Commercial  Center  -  Monday  –  Saturday:  8:00  AM  –  8:30  PM  -  Sunday  &  Public  Holidays:  9:00  AM  –  6:00  PM   3.  ORDERING  &  DELIVERY  POLICY  -  Delivery  Options:  Home  Delivery  and  In-Store  Pick-up  available.  -  Delivery  Cut-off:  Orders  placed  before  3:00  PM  are  eligible  for  same-day  delivery.  -  Delivery  Charges:  Standard  local  delivery  is  calculated  based  on  distance  at  checkout.  Free  
delivery
 
applies
 
on
 
orders
 
above
 
KSh
 
5,000.
  4.  PAYMENT  METHODS  We  accept:  -  M-Pesa  (Till  /  Paybill)  -  Cash  on  Delivery  -  Debit  /  Credit  Cards  (Visa  &  Mastercard)   5.  RETURN  &  REFUND  POLICY  -  Perishable  Goods  (Fresh  Produce,  Dairy,  Bakery):  Issues  must  be  reported  within  24  hours  of  
receiving
 
the
 
delivery
 
for
 
replacement
 
or
 
refund.
 -  Non-Perishable  Goods  (Dry  Staples,  Packaged  Foods,  Household  Items):  Can  be  returned  or  
exchanged
 
within
 
7
 
days
 
of
 
purchase,
 
provided
 
items
 
are
 
unopened,
 
unused,
 
and
 
accompanied
 
by
 
the
 
original
 
receipt.
  6.  CUSTOMER  SUPPORT  &  ENQUIRIES  For  order  updates,  bulk  purchases,  or  general  enquiries:  -  WhatsApp  /  Phone  Support:  Available  during  store  operating  hours.  -  Email:  support@basmatisupermarket.com   